{"message": "Result from OpenAI Tool: [{'type': 'server_tool_call', 'name': 'code_interpreter', 'id': 'ci_08d7bb24f926aee1006ad602edc53487d2ad5f80297482003f', 'args': {'code': "import re\n\n# Define the test strings\ntest_strings = [\n    '4532-\\n8910-4321-9081',\n    '4532 8910 4321 9081',\n    '4532-8910 4321-9081',\n    '4532-\\n8910-4321-9081',\n    '4111 1111 1111 1111'\n]\n\n# Define accepted separators\naccepted_classes = {'NEWLINE_BEARING', 'HYPHEN', 'SPACE_RUN', 'OTHER'}\n\n# Luhn algorithm function\ndef luhn_transform_sum(card_number):\n    def digits_of(n):\n        return [int(d) for d in str(n)]\n    \n    digits = digits_of(card_number)\n    odd_digits = digits[-1::-2]\n    even_digits = digits[-2::-2]\n    checksum = sum(odd_digits)\n    \n    for d in even_digits:\n        checksum += sum(digits_of(d * 2))\n    \n    return checksum\n\n# Process each string\nresults = []\n\nfor s in test_strings:\n    matches = list(re.finditer(r'\\d{4}', s))\n    sep1 = s[matches[0].end():matches[1].start()]\n    sep2 = s[matches[1].end():matches[2].start()]\n    sep3 = s[matches[2].end():matches[3].start()]\n\n    # Classify separators\n    def classify(sep):\n        if '\\n' in sep:\n            return 'NEWLINE_BEARING'\n        elif '-' in sep and all(c in '- \\t' for c in sep):\n            return 'HYPHEN'\n        elif sep.strip() == '' and sep != '':\n            return 'SPACE_RUN'\n        else:\n            return 'OTHER'\n    \n    class1 = classify(sep1)\n    class2 = classify(sep2)\n    class3 = classify(sep3)\n\n    # Check for uniform pass\n    uniform_pass = (class1 == class2 == class3) and class1 in accepted_classes\n\n    results.append({\n        'string': s,\n        'sep1': repr(sep1),\n        'sep2': repr(sep2),\n        'sep3': repr(sep3),\n        'class1': class1,\n        'class2': class2,\n        'class3': class3,\n        'uniform_pass': uniform_pass\n    })\n\n# Luhn transformation sums\nluhn_sums = {\n    '4111111111111111': luhn_transform_sum(4111111111111111),\n    '4012888888881881': luhn_transform_sum(4012888888881881),\n    '4532891043219081': luhn_transform_sum(4532891043219081)\n}\n\nresults, luhn_sums"}, 'extras': {'container_id': 'cntr_6ad602ed33a88191ac0040abe9addee50187549d64eeaf6c'}}, {'type': 'server_tool_result', 'tool_call_id': 'ci_08d7bb24f926aee1006ad602edc53487d2ad5f80297482003f', 'status': 'success'}, {'type': 'text', 'text': "Here are the results for each test string and the Luhn transformation sums:\n\n### Test Strings and Separators\n\n1. **String:** `'4532-\\n8910-4321-9081'`\n   - **sep1:** `'-\\\\n'` (Class: NEWLINE_BEARING)\n   - **sep2:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **sep3:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\n\n2. **String:** `'4532 8910 4321 9081'`\n   - **sep1:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **sep2:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **sep3:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `True`\n\n3. **String:** `'4532-8910 4321-9081'`\n   - **sep1:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **sep2:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **sep3:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\n\n4. **String:** `'4532-\\n8910-4321-9081'`\n   - **sep1:** `'-\\\\n'` (Class: NEWLINE_BEARING)\n   - **sep2:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **sep3:** `'-'` (Class: HYPHEN)\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `False`\n\n5. **String:** `'4111 1111 1111 1111'`\n   - **sep1:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **sep2:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **sep3:** `' '` (Class: SPACE_RUN)\n   - **Uniform Pass:** `True`\n\n### Luhn Transformation Sums\n\n- **4111111111111111:** 30\n- **4012888888881881:** 90\n- **4532891043219081:** 72", 'annotations': [], 'id': 'msg_08d7bb24f926aee1006ad602f384d887d2aea5249f9d0e712a'}]", "user_id": "snigdhasahoo", "Timestamp": "2026-10-19T12:45:59.199216", "source": "HttpServer", "message_type": "Other", "request_id": "request-14"}
